          ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\cos x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The function is zero at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}.$\n- **II.** The function has a minimum value at $x=\\pi.$\n- **III.** The function is zero at $x=\\frac{3\\pi}{2}.$",
